# On Bot2's turn the Paladin has no first strike (CR 613.1f), so a block is ordinary simultaneous damage. Bot1's Paladin does not
# attack on turn 3; on turn 4 Bot2's Memnite attacks and the Paladin blocks it: the Memnite deals its 1 damage and dies.

[Bot1 Deck]
Mox Pearl
Mox Sapphire
Gleemox
Inspiring Paladin
Island x13

[Bot2 Deck]
Memnite
Island x15

[Actions]
Bot1.Hand.Mox Pearl.Cast
Bot1.Hand.Mox Sapphire.Cast
Bot1.Hand.Gleemox.Cast
Bot1.Battlefield.Mox Pearl.Activate
Bot1.Battlefield.Mox Sapphire.Activate
Bot1.Battlefield.Gleemox.Activate(Color: White)
Bot1.Hand.Inspiring Paladin.Cast
Bot1.Pass
Bot2.Pass
[T2 Bot2.Main1]
Bot2.Hand.Memnite.Cast
[T4 Bot2.DeclareAttackers]
Bot2.Attack(Memnite > Bot1)
Bot1.Block(Inspiring Paladin > Memnite)
? Bot1.Battlefield.Inspiring Paladin.Keywords = (absent)
Bot2.Pass
Bot1.Pass
[T4 Bot2.Main2]

[Expect]
Turn = 4
Bot1.Life = 20
Bot1.Battlefield.Inspiring Paladin.Damage = 1
Bot2.Graveyard = Memnite
